" class=\"drawer-cta-secondary\" aria-label=\"Explore Studio\"><svg class=\"cta-grid-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;vertical-align:-.15em;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"/></svg><span>Explore Studio</span></a></div><div class=\"mobile-menu-footer\"><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-brand\">ConstBooth<br><span style=\"text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal\">One frame. Beyond distance.</span></span><span class=\"mobile-menu-footer-version\">v2.0.0</span></div></nav><header class=\"main-header full-header\"><div class=\"header-left\"><a href=\"/\" id=\"logo-trigger-top\" class=\"app-logo\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo.svg?v=35ddb567\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><nav class=\"header-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#booth-types\">Booths</a> <a href=\"/studio\">Studio</a> <a href=\"/#how\">How it works</a> <a href=\"/blog\">Blog</a> <a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"header-actions\"><a href=\"/booth\" class=\"nav-cta\"><svg class=\"cta-icon-camera\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:1.18em;height:1.18em;vertical-align:-.18em;margin-right:7px;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Enter Photobooth</span></a></div></header><main id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"page-content-wrap\"><section class=\"hero reveal\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Get in touch</div><h1>Contact the ConstBooth team: support, feedback and <span class=\"accent\">ideas</span></h1><p>Whether it's a bug, a question, or just a good idea - feel free to reach out. We read everything and do our best to respond quickly.</p></section>\n<div class=\"contact-grid\"><div class=\"contact-card\"><div class=\"contact-card-icon\" style=\"background:#ffe100;color:#000\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"></path><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"contact-card-label\">Say hello</div><div class=\"contact-card-title\">General</div><div class=\"contact-card-desc\">Have a question, partnership inquiry, or just want to say hi? Drop us a note anytime. We'd love to hear from you.</div><a href=\"mailto:hello@lensbooth.app\" class=\"contact-card-action\"><span>hello@lensbooth.app</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg></a></div><div class=\"contact-card\"><div class=\"contact-card-icon\" style=\"background:#2ab09c;color:#000\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"contact-card-label\">Got ideas or found a bug?</div><div class=\"contact-card-title\">Feedback</div><div class=\"contact-card-desc\">Whether you've found a bug, have an idea for a new feature, or want to share feedback, we'd love to hear it.</div><button type=\"button\" id=\"home-feedback-btn\" class=\"contact-card-action\"><span>Share Feedback</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg></button></div><div class=\"contact-card\"><div class=\"contact-card-icon\" style=\"background:#ff6de4;color:#000\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"contact-card-label\">Connection issues?</div><div class=\"contact-card-title\">Shared Booth</div><div class=\"contact-card-desc\">Shared Booth connects you and your friend directly peer-to-peer. If something isn't working, let us know your browser and network and we'll help you figure it out.</div><a href=\"mailto:hello@lensbooth.app?subject=Shared%20Booth%20Help\" class=\"contact-card-action\"><span>Get help</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg></a></div><div class=\"contact-card\"><div class=\"contact-card-icon\" style=\"background:#4da6ff;color:#000\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"contact-card-label\">Questions about your data?</div><div class=\"contact-card-title\">Privacy</div><div class=\"contact-card-desc\">For questions about your data, access, correction, or deletion requests, write to support@lensbooth.app.</div><a href=\"/privacy\" class=\"contact-card-action\"><span>Read privacy policy</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"7\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"7\"></line><polyline points=\"7 7 17 7 17 17\"></polyline></svg></a></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\"><h2 class=\"faq-title\">Quick <span class=\"accent\">answers</span></h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do I need to create an account?</h3><div class=\"faq-a\">No. ConstBooth works instantly - no sign-up, no email, no password. Just open and start.</div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-q\">Are my photos stored anywhere?</h3><div class=\"faq-a\">No by default. Guest Solo and Shared Booth photos are processed directly on your device or streamed directly between participants peer-to-peer and are never stored on our servers. If you choose to sign in with Google and save photo strips, they are stored securely in your private cloud gallery until you delete them.</div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-q\">How does Shared Booth work?</h3><div class=\"faq-a\">Shared Booth connects two people directly using peer-to-peer connection. Your camera feed goes straight to the other person - not through any server. The booth session closes automatically after inactivity.</div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-q\">Which browsers are supported?</h3><div class=\"faq-a\">ConstBooth works on modern browsers like Chrome, Firefox, Safari, and Edge. For Shared Booth, Chrome or Firefox works best.</div></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3 class=\"faq-q\">Is ConstBooth free?</h3><div class=\"faq-a\">Yes - completely free. No subscriptions, no hidden fees. Just open and capture.</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\"><h2 class=\"faq-title\">Before you <span class=\"accent\">write</span></h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><div class=\"faq-a\">A lot of questions already have a written answer. If your camera will not start, try <a href=\"/blog/fix-camera-not-working-in-browser\">the six fixes for a camera not working in your browser</a>, or reset the permission directly using <a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/2693767\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chrome's own instructions</a> (the underlying behaviour is defined by the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Permissions_API\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Permissions API</a>). If you are not sure what ConstBooth does yet, start with <a href=\"/blog/what-is-a-virtual-photo-booth\">what a virtual photo booth is</a>, or just <a href=\"/booth\">open the booth</a>. For questions about photos and data the <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy policy</a> is the full answer, and the <a href=\"/guidelines\">community guidelines</a> cover what may be captured and shared.</div></div></div></div>\n\n\n</main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><div class=\"footer-logo\"><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"ConstBooth\"><img src=\"/assets/logo-footer.svg?v=b1cb43c4\" alt=\"ConstBooth\" class=\"footer-logo-img\" width=\"134\" height=\"36\"></a></div><p class=\"footer-tagline\">One frame. Beyond distance.</p><div class=\"footer-socials\"><a href