hunt\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/lensbooth?embed=true&amp;utm_source=badge-featured&amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;utm_campaign=badge-lensbooth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"ConstBooth - Create photo strips solo or with friends, from anywhere. | Product Hunt\" width=\"250\" height=\"54\" src=\"/assets/ph-badge.svg?v=9c7f8c3e\"></a><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/M8X721EIGR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"kofi-button\" title=\"Support Us\" aria-label=\"Support Us on Ko-fi\"><svg class=\"kofi-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M23.881 8.948c-.773-4.085-4.859-4.593-4.859-4.593H.723c-.604 0-.679.798-.679.798s-.082 7.324-.022 11.822c.164 2.424 2.586 2.672 2.586 2.672s8.267.023 11.966-.049c2.438-.426 2.683-2.566 2.658-3.734 4.352.24 7.422-2.831 6.649-6.916zm-11.062 3.511c-1.246 1.453-4.011 3.976-4.011 3.976s-.121.119-.31.023c-.076-.057-.108-.09-.108-.09-.443-.441-3.368-3.049-4.034-3.954-.709-.965-1.041-2.7-.091-3.71.951-1.01 3.005-1.086 4.363.407 0 0 1.565-1.782 3.468-.963 1.904.82 1.832 3.011.723 4.311zm6.173.478c-.928.116-1.682.028-1.682.028V7.284h1.77s1.971.551 1.971 2.373c0 1.822-1.131 2.766-2.059 2.879z\"/></svg><span>Support Us</span></a></div></div><nav class=\"footer-nav\" aria-label=\"Footer navigation\"><div class=\"footer-nav-group\"><span class=\"footer-nav-label\">Product</span> <a href=\"/#booth-types\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">Booths</a> <a href=\"/studio\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">Studio</a> <a href=\"/#how\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">How it Works</a></div><div class=\"footer-nav-group\"><span class=\"footer-nav-label\">General</span> <a href=\"/about\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">About</a> <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">Contact</a> <a href=\"/blog\" class=\"footer-nav-link\">Blog</a></div><div class=\"footer-nav-group\"><span class=\"footer-nav-label\">Resources</span> <a href=\"/blog/photo-strip-sizes-a